{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/extras/19cf13600a6641fe96d7fda4de0da2a3.avif?t=1761095647\" width=1280 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOALAS DELIV &amp; GUY</strong> is a physics-based, comedy action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a flying<strong> KOALA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you\u2019ve got the power to unleash a mighty shockwave \u2014 the <strong>KOALAS WAVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy is <strong>NICEGUY</strong>, a super-flexible, floppy human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's a really good dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use KOALAS WAVE to launch, float, and guide Nice Guy all the way to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t get cocky \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Nice Guy goes off-course even once, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries, though \u2014 you can retry as many times as you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashes, slips, falls... it won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Koala and Nice Guy are an unbreakable team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust in your bond and aim for the goal \u2014 together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flying KOALA...? For real?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou control a koala that can fly freely through the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can phase through any object</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can unleash two kinds of KOALAS WAVE \u2014 one light, one strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is this \u201c<strong>NICEGUY</strong>\u201d?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHe\u2019s super tough \u2014 nothing makes him mad, no matter how hard he crashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThrough intense training, he became a floppy man</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHe trusts the koala with all his heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction Buttons (Left Stick):</strong> Move the Koala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A (B) Button or A (S) Key:</strong> Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F Key or Y Button:</strong> Open Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Streaming Guidelines \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome gameplay videos and live streams of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the Steam store page URL in your video description or stream details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong><br>This game was created with <strong>Action Game Maker MV</strong>, so <strong>Steam achievements are not supported.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886310?t=1761095647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/40dcce5b0c3709140c5038008373c411292c9718/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761095647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/6a664e41006051801cfb64d2ac6423f84e0c189e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761095647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/6a664e41006051801cfb64d2ac6423f84e0c189e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761095647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"