ough the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can phase through any object</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can unleash two kinds of KOALAS WAVE \u2014 one light, one strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is this \u201c<strong>NICEGUY</strong>\u201d?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHe\u2019s super tough \u2014 nothing makes him mad, no matter how hard he crashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThrough intense training, he became a floppy man</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHe trusts the koala with all his heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction Buttons (Left Stick):</strong> Move the Koala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A (B) Button or A (S) Key:</strong> Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F Key or Y Button:</strong> Open Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Streaming Guidelines \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome gameplay videos and live streams of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the Steam store page URL in your video description or stream details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong><br>This game was created with <strong>Action Game Maker MV</strong>, so <strong>Steam achievements are not supported.</strong></p>","developers":["RYO.DESIGN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/cdf08d574ad3a9b1586ab9c10b30541c5ee4b243/header.jpg?t=1761095647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recomme